OL,3,GNEWSAOne-way traffic system set after
OL,4,Afootbridge shut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary one-way traffic system is
OL,7,Fset to come into force in part of
OL,8,FHereford following the closure of a
OL,9,Fdeteriorating footbridge.
OL,11,FThe traffic lights and safety
OL,12,Farrangements are introduced this week
OL,13,Fafter the closure of the College Road
OL,14,Fbridge, in Hereford.
OL,16,FThe one-way system, from Barrs Court
OL,17,FRoad towards Widemarsh Street, will
OL,18,Freplace temporary traffic lights in
OL,19,Fresponse to feedback from residents and
OL,20,Froad users, said Herefordshire Council.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
