OL,3,GNEWSAOne-way traffic system set after
OL,4,Afootbridge shut
OL,5,
OL,6,Fthe "ageing 1963 footbridge" was closed
OL,7,Fafter an inspection found structurally
OL,8,Fsignificant defects, said the
OL,9,Fauthority, which has applied for
OL,10,Fgovernment funds to help towards
OL,11,Freplacing it.
